  "content": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the minimum order for MOMUTO custom football kits?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"MOMUTO has no minimum order. A single custom jersey starts at €38.90. For team orders of 10 or more, the full kit (jersey + shorts) drops to €26.90 per player with free professional design included. We handle five-a-side teams, full squads, esports orgs, and one-off orders equally.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How long does it take to get custom football kits from MOMUTO?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"MOMUTO delivers custom kits in 25–30 days worldwide. Production takes 7–15 days and shipping transit takes 10–15 days direct from factory. The free professional design mockup is delivered within 1–2 days of receiving your brief, with free revisions included.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is the kit design service really free?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. MOMUTO offers two free design options: a real-time 3D configurator with 30+ professional templates, or a free professional design service where MOMUTO's team creates a fully custom mockup in 1–2 days with free revisions included. You only pay when you place an order.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can MOMUTO manufacture kits from an AI-generated design?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. MOMUTO is one of the only custom kit suppliers that accepts AI-generated concepts (from ChatGPT, Midjourney, Gemini, or any design tool) and converts them into production-ready kits. Professional designers handle the full technical translation — resolution upscaling, seam mapping, size grading across S–XXL, and color conversion to sublimation inks. Free for team orders of 10 or more. A €30 deposit may apply for highly complex designs, deducted in full from the order.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"I don't have a logo or design — can MOMUTO help?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. MOMUTO's design team works from scratch. Share your colors, team name, a mood reference, or even a rough sketch — a professional designer will build a full custom kit identity in 1–2 days, free, with revisions included. No design skills required.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&amp;family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n  /* ===== VARIABLES ===== */\n  :root {\n    --mg-dark:    #0a0a0a;\n    --mg-panel:   #111;\n    --mg-light:   #f4f4f5;\n    --mg-white:   #ffffff;\n    --mg-border:  #e4e4e7;\n    --mg-muted:   #71717a;\n    --mg-mid:     #52525b;\n    --mg-red:     #c8352e;\n    --font-display: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;\n    --font-body:    'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  .title { display: none; }\n\n  body {\n    font-family: var(--font-body);\n    color: var(--mg-dark);\n    background: var(--mg-dark);\n  }\n\n  .cnt-container {\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 40px;\n  }\n\n  /* ===== HERO — DARK ===== */\n  .cnt-hero {\n    background: var(--mg-dark);\n    padding: 7rem 0 6rem;\n    text-align: center;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n  }\n\n  .cnt-hero-eyebrow {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-family: var(--font-body);\n    font-size: 0.62rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--mg-red);\n    background: rgba(200,53,46,0.1);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(200,53,46,0.2);\n    padding: 5px 14px;\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n  }\n\n  .cnt-hero-title {\n    font-family: var(--font-display);\n    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem);\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: #fff;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.03em;\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .cnt-hero-sub {\n    font-family: var(--font-body);\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: #71717a;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n\n  .cnt-hero .cnt-hero-promise {\n    font-family: var(--font-body);\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    color: #a1a1aa;\n    max-width: 480px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    margin-inline-start: auto;\n    margin-inline-end: auto;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .cnt-hero-promise strong {\n    color: #fff;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  /* ===== CONTACT METHODS — LIGHT ===== */\n  .cnt-methods {\n    background: var(--mg-light);\n    padding: 6rem 0;\n  }\n\n  .cnt-methods-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 2px;\n    max-width: 960px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: var(--mg-border);\n  }\n\n  .cnt-method {\n    background: var(--mg-white);\n    padding: 3rem 2.5rem;\n    text-align: center;\n    transition: background 0.2s;\n  }\n\n  .cnt-method:hover {\n    background: #fafafa;\n  }\n\n  .cnt-method-icon {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    width: 52px;\n    height: 52px;\n    border: 1.5px solid var(--mg-dark);\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n    color: var(--mg-dark);\n  }\n\n  .cnt-method-title {\n    font-family: var(--font-display);\n    font-size: 1.6rem;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--mg-dark);\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .cnt-method-sub {\n    font-family: var(--font-body);\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    color: var(--mg-muted);\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;\n    min-height: 2.5em;\n  }\n\n  .cnt-method-btn {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: var(--mg-dark);\n    color: #fff;\n    font-family: var(--font-body);\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 0.72rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.13em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    padding: 14px 28px;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: background 0.2s;\n  }\n\n  .cnt-method-btn:hover {\n    background: var(--mg-red);\n  }\n\n  .cnt-method-response {\n    font-family: var(--font-body);\n    font-size: 0.65rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--mg-muted);\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n    margin-top: 1.5rem;\n    padding-top: 1rem;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n  }\n\n  /* ===== FAQ — WHITE ===== */\n  .cnt-faq {\n    background: var(--mg-white);\n    padding: 6rem 0;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n  }\n\n  .cnt-faq-header {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .cnt-faq-title {\n    font-family: var(--font-display);\n    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--mg-dark);\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .cnt-faq-intro {\n    font-family: var(--font-body);\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    color: var(--mg-muted);\n    letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  }\n\n  .cnt-faq-grid {\n    max-width: 760px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  details.cnt-faq-item {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n  }\n\n  details.cnt-faq-item:first-of-type {\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n  }\n\n  summary.cnt-faq-q {\n    font-family: var(--font-body);\n    font-size: 0.88rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.07em;\n    color: var(--mg-dark);\n    padding: 1.4rem 0;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    list-style: none;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    transition: color 0.2s;\n  }\n\n  summary.cnt-faq-q:hover { color: var(--mg-red); }\n\n  summary.cnt-faq-q::after {\n    content: '+';\n    font-family: var(--font-body);\n    font-size: 1.3rem;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    color: var(--mg-muted);\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    margin-left: 1rem;\n    transition: color 0.2s;\n  }\n\n  details[open] summary.cnt-faq-q::after { content: '−'; color: var(--mg-red); }\n  details[open] summary.cnt-faq-q { color: var(--mg-red); }\n\n  summary.cnt-faq-q::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n\n  .cnt-faq-a {\n    font-family: var(--font-body);\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    color: var(--mg-mid);\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    padding: 0 2rem 1.75rem 0;\n  }\n\n  .cnt-faq-a strong {\n    color: var(--mg-dark);\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  /* ===== FOOTER CTA — DARK ===== */\n  .cnt-footer-cta {\n    background: var(--mg-dark);\n    padding: 7rem 0;\n    text-align: center;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n  }\n\n  .cnt-cta-title {\n    font-family: var(--font-display);\n    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: #fff;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.03em;\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n\n  .cnt-cta-sub {\n    font-family: var(--font-body);\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    color: #a1a1aa;\n    max-width: 420px;\n    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n\n  .cnt-cta-sub strong {\n    color: #fff;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  .cnt-cta-btn {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: var(--mg-dark);\n    font-family: var(--font-body);\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 0.82rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    padding: 20px 52px;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;\n  }\n\n  .cnt-cta-btn:hover {\n    background: var(--mg-red);\n    color: #fff;\n  }\n\n  /* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .cnt-container { padding: 0 20px; }\n    .cnt-hero { padding: 5rem 0 4rem; }\n    .cnt-methods-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .cnt-method { padding: 2.5rem 2rem; }\n    .cnt-footer-cta { padding: 5rem 0; }\n  }\n</style>\n<!-- ===== HERO ===== -->\n<section class=\"cnt-hero\">\n<div class=\"cnt-container\">\n<div class=\"cnt-hero-eyebrow\">Support &amp; Design Requests</div>\n<h1 class=\"cnt-hero-title\">Get in Touch</h1>\n<p class=\"cnt-hero-sub\">Kit Design &middot; Orders &middot; Collaborations</p>\n<p class=\"cnt-hero-promise\">Send us your idea &mdash; sketch, AI concept, or just a brief. <strong>Design mockup in 1&ndash;2 days, free.</strong></p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- ===== CONTACT METHODS ===== -->\n<section class=\"cnt-methods\">\n<div class=\"cnt-container\">\n<div class=\"cnt-methods-grid\">\n<div class=\"cnt-method\"><span class=\"cnt-method-icon\"> <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"> <path d=\"M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z\"></path> </svg> </span>\n<h3 class=\"cnt-method-title\">WhatsApp</h3>\n<p class=\"cnt-method-sub\">Quick replies. Send your sketches, AI concepts, or urgent questions.</p>\n<a href=\"https://wa.me/34614625408?text=Hello%20MOMUTO%2C%20I%20want%20info%20about...\" class=\"cnt-method-btn\">Start Chat</a>\n<div class=\"cnt-method-response\">Avg. response: 3&ndash;4 hours</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cnt-method\"><span class=\"cnt-method-icon\"> <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"> <rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"5\"></rect> <path d=\"M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z\"></path> <line x1=\"17.5\" y1=\"6.5\" x2=\"17.51\" y2=\"6.5\"></line> </svg> </span>\n<h3 class=\"cnt-method-title\">Instagram</h3>\n<p class=\"cnt-method-sub\">DM for collabs and creative projects. See our latest drops.</p>\n<a href=\"https://instagram.com/momutofc\" class=\"cnt-method-btn\">@momutofc</a>\n<div class=\"cnt-method-response\">Avg. response: same day</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cnt-method\"><span class=\"cnt-method-icon\"> <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"> <path d=\"M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z\"></path> <polyline points=\"22,6 12,13 2,6\"></polyline> </svg> </span>\n<h3 class=\"cnt-method-title\">Email</h3>\n<p class=\"cnt-method-sub\">Large team orders, billing, and technical questions.</p>\n<a href=\"mailto:info@momuto.com\" class=\"cnt-method-btn\">Send Email</a>\n<div class=\"cnt-method-response\">Avg. response: 24 hours</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- ===== FAQ ===== -->\n<section class=\"cnt-faq\">\n<div class=\"cnt-container\">\n<div class=\"cnt-faq-header\">\n<h2 class=\"cnt-faq-title\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<p class=\"cnt-faq-intro\">Everything you need to know before placing your order.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cnt-faq-grid\">\n<details class=\"cnt-faq-item\">\n<summary class=\"cnt-faq-q\">What's the minimum order?</summary>\n<div class=\"cnt-faq-a\">There is no minimum. A single jersey starts at <strong>&euro;38.90</strong>. For team orders of 10+, the full kit (jersey + shorts) drops to <strong>&euro;26.90 per player</strong> &mdash; with free professional design included. We handle five-a-side teams, full squads, esports orgs, and one-off orders equally.</div>\n</details>\n<details class=\"cnt-faq-item\">\n<summary class=\"cnt-faq-q\">What are the delivery times?</summary>\n<div class=\"cnt-faq-a\">Custom kits are delivered in <strong>25&ndash;30 days worldwide</strong> &mdash; 7&ndash;15 days production plus 10&ndash;15 days direct shipping from factory. Your free design mockup is ready within <strong>1&ndash;2 days</strong> of your brief, revisions included. We ship to all of Europe, North America, and beyond.</div>\n</details>\n<details class=\"cnt-faq-item\">\n<summary class=\"cnt-faq-q\">Is the design service really free?</summary>\n<div class=\"cnt-faq-a\">Yes, completely free. Choose between a <strong>real-time 3D configurator</strong> with 30+ templates, or send us your idea and a <strong>professional human designer</strong> will build your custom mockup in 1&ndash;2 days with unlimited revisions. You only pay when you approve the design and place your order.</div>\n</details>\n<details class=\"cnt-faq-item\">\n<summary class=\"cnt-faq-q\">Can you work from an AI-generated design?</summary>\n<div class=\"cnt-faq-a\">Yes &mdash; and we're one of the only suppliers that can. Send us an image from <strong>ChatGPT, Midjourney, Gemini</strong>, or any design tool. Our designers handle the full technical translation: resolution upscaling to 8K vectors, seam mapping, size grading across S&ndash;XXL, and color conversion to sublimation inks. <strong>Free for orders of 10+ kits.</strong> A &euro;30 deposit may apply for highly complex designs, deducted in full from your order.</div>\n</details>\n<details class=\"cnt-faq-item\">\n<summary class=\"cnt-faq-q\">I don't have a logo or design &mdash; can you help?</summary>\n<div class=\"cnt-faq-a\">Absolutely. Share your colors, team name, a mood reference &mdash; even a rough sketch or a description &mdash; and a <strong>professional designer will build your full kit identity in 1&ndash;2 days, free</strong>, with revisions included. No design skills needed on your side.</div>\n</details>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- ===== FOOTER CTA ===== -->\n<section class=\"cnt-footer-cta\">\n<div class=\"cnt-container\">\n<h2 class=\"cnt-cta-title\">Start Your Kit Today</h2>\n<p class=\"cnt-cta-sub\">Send us your idea today. <strong>Design mockup in 1&ndash;2 days, free.</strong> No commitment until you approve.</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.momuto.com/pages/request-custom-kit-design\" class=\"cnt-cta-btn\">Start My Design</a></div>\n</section>",
